    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Auxiliary Cadre",
    "summary": "Friendly KROOT or VESPID STINGWINGS units gain Harnessed Alien Instincts, which lets such a unit, during your Shooting phase, pick an enemy unit that is visible to it and within 12″; the chosen unit becomes prey‑marked, and a prey‑marked unit gets +3″ to its detection range. Also, friendly GHOSTKEEL BATTLESUIT or STEALTH BATTLESUITS units gain Localised Stealth Projectors (Aura): after a friendly KROOT or VESPID STINGWINGS unit that is within 6″ of that unit has shot, its attacks do not stop it from being hidden. The detachment carries the AUXILIARIES tag, so it cannot be taken together with another AUXILIARIES detachment.",
